Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.32,*ENG,1,0,0,0,,Ah, the Heckler & Koch G- 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.69,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,Quite deadly in the right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.01,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,Ah, Agent One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:07.31,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,I have been so looking forward to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:12.03,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'll try not to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:17.24,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,You overestimate your power over women, Mr English.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.37,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,I'd say that would be virtually impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:38.47,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,Sir?Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.34,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,Sir! Have you got them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:46.22,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,- Hmm? - The mission documents. Agent One's flying tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:50.95,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,Yes, the mission documents. They're here somewhere. Ah, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.70,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,Agent One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.66,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.00,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,I'm here for my documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:09.42,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,Bough, Agent One's documents, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.26,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.47,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Your mission documents, Agent One.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:21.43,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,Including the codes for the submarine hatch, which I've checked myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:24.31,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.00,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,So, is it just France tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.56,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,or will you be slipping over the Pyrenees as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:33.53,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,If I told you that, I'm afraid I'd have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:37.95,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:43.55,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, yes. Well, I expect you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.63,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,Cheerio, Agent One.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:48.92,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,Bonne chance. Arrivederci.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:55.43,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,Such class. Such distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:58.02,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.23,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:03.94,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:09.28,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,The greatest secret agent England's ever had snuffed out in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:12.24,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:16.41,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,Do you know what makes us envied the world over, Bough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:20.42,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,- That there's always another agent waiting to step in. - Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.96,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,And every last one of them is gathered around that grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:28.52,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,It is our honour andprivilege to guard them while they grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:32.77,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,Their lives are in our hands, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.58,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,Everything in order, English?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:48.53,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,I think you'll find it's rather more than just in order, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:52.70,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,You're now entering the most secure location in the whole of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:02.72,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,Pegasus, we face a national crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.83,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,Agent One was clearly onto something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:06.85,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,and we have to find out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.97,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,I need another agent on this. Who else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:13.40,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,No one, Prime Minister. They all died in the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.86,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:18.70,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,Well, luckily there is one who survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.11,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.28,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:20.46,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,Johnny English. I'm here to see Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:23.88,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,Still, no sense rushing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.63,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,There are some items you need to sign before your briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.76,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,This is your new retinal I.D. card,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:36.10,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,and this is your level nine security clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.44,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,Sign and date, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.73,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.57,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,Oh, reminds me of the old service issue ballpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:49.19,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,I remember every agent would carry a pen that looked just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:52.62,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,Completely innocent to the untrained eye, but click it twice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.83,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,Ah, English, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.96,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,Have you seen my secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:05.38,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,Um... she went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:10.31,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,Um... shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:17.61,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,Now, Agent One believed that there was a plot to steal the Crown Jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.94,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,They've recently been through a multimillion- pound restoration,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.24,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,Iargely paid for by a corporate sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:26.86,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,They're d ue to be unveiled toni ght at the T ower of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:31.25,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,The queen is insisting that the ceremony goes ahead, so what we want you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:37.46,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,Hah! Who- Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:40.26,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,Who is the sponsor, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.75,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Pascal Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.88,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,What, that flouncy Frenchman who owns a couple of prisons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:49.39,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,Sauvage's ￡7 billion empire, English,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:52.52,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,operates over 400 prisons in 60 countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:55.15,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,- He's built 25 of them here. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.99,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,The man's related to the royal family, for goodness'sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:00.63,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,As far as the prime minister's concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:03.20,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,he's one of the greatest friends England's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:09.12,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Now, English, I want you at the Tower tonight, monitoring this unveiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.83,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,Any chink in security, any weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:14.79,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,however slight, must be plugged immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.34,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,Do we understand each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:19.51,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,- Perfectly, sir. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.43,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,- Oh, yes. And, - uh, English...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:26.22,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,we can't afford any mistakes... not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:31.11,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,The word "mistake, " sir, is not one that appears in my dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:35.40,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.24,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,Fantastic car, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:53.34,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,Mr English, Colonel Sir Anthony Chevenix, head of Royal Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.42,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,Ah, Colonel, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:58.47,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,- Snipers posted on the roof as per my request? - Thirteen of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:01.60,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,- Windows? - Refitted with bullet and shatter-proof glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.73,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,I shall now mingle inconspicuously with the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:11.90,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,- Let me know when Her Majesty arrives. - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.70,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,Shall I mingle with you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:17.99,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, Bough. Once you've checked the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.77,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.90,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:48.02,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,Hello yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.03,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:53.74,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,Lorna Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.75,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,A Bloody Mary, please, not too spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:00.50,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,So, are you here in some professional capacity?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.96,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,I worked on the restoration of the jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:06.08,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,- Intriguing. - And yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:09.96,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,If I told you that, I'm afraid I'd have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:12.35,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:21.48,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,Monsieur Sauvage, on behalf of Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:23.86,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,may I welcome you to the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.52,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,Merci, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.44,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,So, are you here alone, Mr English?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:31.70,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,That's how I choose to live my life, Miss Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.67,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Women want safety, security. I can offer them nothing but danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.67,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,Some women find danger very attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:42.92,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,Women like you, Miss Campbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:48.01,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,Women like me expect men like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.34,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,to find that out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:53.27,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.23,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:12:00.98,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,Oh, it's for me, actually. Could your rustle up some of those cheesy niblets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:03.53,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.57,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,You obviously haven't met our host, Monsieur Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.82,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,No, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:13.66,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,You know, I think I'd rather have my bottom impaled on a giant cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.51,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,than exchange pleasantries with that jumped- up Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:21.72,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, the only thing the French should host is an invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:25.97,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,Sorry, can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:29.72,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,Pascal Sauvage, jumped- up Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.93,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,Lorna Campbell. I've been so looking forward to meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:35.69,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,Enchante
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.98,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,But of course! You're Johnny English. I've heard all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.74,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,And between you and me, I'm not so keen on the French myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:45.83,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,But please don't tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:49.25,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,Let me go and search for your nibbly cheese bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.33,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,- No, no, no. I... - I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.33,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,The French are, after all, fantastic waiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.63,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,- The best in the world. - Well- But- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.92,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,- Wait here, and I will wait on you. - No, really. There's no...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:02.35,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,No. Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:06.64,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,Hmm. Les Francais.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:12.15,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,Ils sont very... n'est- ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:31.09,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, mesdames est messieurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:35.84,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,bienvenus, welcome tonight to this wonderful occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.80,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,As we stand here in the Tower of London,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:42.05,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,the most famous prison in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:45.73,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,where these wonderful jewels will rest safely...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.02,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,under lock and key,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.95,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,I want to thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.32,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,for giving me this wonderful experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:59.04,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,to contribute to the restoration of these jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:03.62,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,It was, as we say in France, le top, le best of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.25,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,And what a beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:32.16,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,It's Colonel Chevenix! He's got a nasty wound, sir. Who hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.86,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,The assailant. He ran in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:38.41,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,Bough, you guard the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:42.20,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:48.42,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,For God's sake, Bough, don't come in. The man's a maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.88,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,You don't frighten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:54.22,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,Missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:27.01,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,I've managed to subdue the assailant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:31.35,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,The panic's over. Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.35,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,Thank you. And now, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.31,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,we should compose ourselves for the arrival of Her Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.61,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,and return to the site of our great nation's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:49.16,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,magnificently restored Crown Jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.41,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,I know. I feel it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:58.00,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,The very symbols of our island nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:16:02.01,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,so close we could almost reach out and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:07.68,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,Pray silence for Her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:10.85,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,Oh, where are thejewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.23,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,It's an unmitigated disaster, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.19,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,I could n't agree more, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:20.06,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,Well, we need to get these jewels back, English, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:24.67,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,Tell me about this assailant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.43,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,When they searched the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:28.20,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,there was no sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:31.21,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,Well, the man was clearly a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:34.50,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,He must have escaped while the queen was being sedated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:37.63,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,But he's the only lead we've got. We have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:41.88,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,Come in. This is... This is Roger from Data Support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:45.14,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,Please sit down. He'll produce a likeness based on your description.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:48.64,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,So tell us, what did this man look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:51.85,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,Um... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:55.19,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,he was... big.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:17:01.32,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,- Hair colour? - Um... orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:04.58,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,- Orange? - Mmm. And curly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.45,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,Well, friZZy, actually. FriZZy sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:11.08,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,- Frizzy. - An eyepatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.79,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,Broken nose. Very few teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:17.21,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,Two, I would say, at the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.72,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,And a scar on his cheek...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:25.22,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,in the shape... of a banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:29.36,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,- Which cheek? - Both cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:32.36,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,They sort of met in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.57,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, English?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:47.16,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, that's him. An uncanny resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:51.63,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,Why, it's just as if he's in the room with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:18:01.86,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,Wow! Look at this, sir. Got all the bells and whistles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.94,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,Never mind about the gad gets. Just focus on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:15.20,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.79,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,Good morning, gentlemen. Thank you very much for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:28.34,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,Now, the question that faces us this morning is a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:33.01,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,Namely, how did the thieves gain access to this highly secure environment...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.43,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,and then escape with thejewels afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:41.52,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,A simple question, but one which I believe has a complex answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:44.86,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,- Actually, sir... Uh, please, - Bough. My mind is at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:47.95,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,Now, what you must grasp, gentlemen, is that the master criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:52.41,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,sees not a room but a series of opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.87,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,Should I go in through the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.95,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:01.59,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,- Should I drop down from the ceiling? - Actually, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:05.59,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,There's one thing I think we can be fairly confident about,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.35,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,that is that they didn't come up through the floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.64,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,I've got you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:13.51,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,That's all right. Just come my way, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:17.39,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,- That'll bring me right over the hole, sir. - There's no need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.03,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,Can you see the bottom yet, Bough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.07,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,Not yet, sir. The shaft appears to be narrowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:28.40,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,I'm just a little bit worried I might get stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:32.54,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,Trust me, Bough. You won't get stuck if you just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.42,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.46,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,I'm okay, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:42.01,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,Are you at the bottom now, Bough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:44.63,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,No, I am in fact stuck now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:48.47,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,Oh, for God's sake, Bough. Stay there! I'm coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:51.81,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm not especially sure that's a good idea, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.73,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.82,0:19:57.36,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,Be careful, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.15,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,Gently does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.00,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:13.21,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,- Are you all right, sir? - Yes. I landed on something quite soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:16.09,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,- That was me, sir. - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.55,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:22.51,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,There's no way back up there, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.68,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,But this must lead somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.93,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,I'm slightly uncomfortable in the dark, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:29.26,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.72,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,It may be pitch black,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.08,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,but we can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.44,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,Can we, sir? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:36.32,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,The Bedouin monks of the Al Maghreb mountains...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.81,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,developed a system of sonic chanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.66,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,- I see, sir. - The sound of their chanting...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:43.99,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,would bounce back off any obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.37,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,and using their highly tuned ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.30,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,they could paint a mental picture of the path ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.58,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,- Brilliant, sir. - However, you must always sing in E-flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:21:00.00,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,∮ E-flat, E-flat, E-flat ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:04.75,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,∮ Thank you for the music, The songs I'm singing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:06.96,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,- Is it working, sir? - Extremely well, thank you, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.78,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,∮ Thanks for all the joy that... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:15.23,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,You all right, sir? I think I can see something, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.86,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:38.93,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,Here is the long one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.14,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,It is a long one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.27,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.44,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,- I knew it. - Shall we call for backup, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:54.53,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,What? And watch some fat- bottomed bobby make our arrest for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.61,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:03.33,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,Good morning, gentlemen. MI7 at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:08.38,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,Observe, Bough, the dull incompetence of the criminal mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:12.72,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,It can never hope to match our level of technical expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:04.07,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,- You've got it. - What do we do now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:06.23,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,Watch and learn, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.44,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,They're too far ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:14.46,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,Have faith, Bough. They're heading south.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:26.09,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,- There they are, sir! - Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:33.48,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,Hang on tight, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:43.73,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,We're never gonna catch them in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.83,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,- Take the wheel, Bough. I'm getting in the Aston. - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:53.91,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,Change places, Bough. I'm getting out the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.00,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.90,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,Set, Bough. Take me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:29.67,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Swing me out, Bough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.51,0:24:37.04,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,- Whoa. - Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.73,0:24:44.30,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,Up! Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:50.19,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.41,0:24:54.53,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,Bough, pull out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:07.00,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,Those idiots are right behind us. Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.85,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.53,0:25:32.69,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,Uh- huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.35,0:26:00.02,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,Drop me here, Bough!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.24,0:26:06.74,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,Ow! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:10.16,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.24,0:26:12.70,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:52.53,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,They're turning into the Brompton Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.63,0:26:56.16,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,Get here as soon as you can. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:07.93,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,In a wheelchair. But Geoffrey overcame these terrible disabilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.02,0:27:11.89,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,with that simple resilience and sunny optimism...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:15.18,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,that so warmed all of us who knew him,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.28,0:27:17.73,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,spending the rest of his life in the service...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.82,0:27:20.82,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,of the poor and disabled of this parish.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:25.12,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,It's very good. Really very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.20,0:27:27.96,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,It's very entertaining. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.04,0:27:30.91,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,- It's very entertaining. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:36.08,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,That priest act of yours should keep the other prisoners entertained for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.18,0:27:39.13,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry. Where are my manners? Johnny English,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.22,0:27:42.47,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,British Secret Service, and you are all under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:45.23,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,I must say you've done this whole thing very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.31,0:27:47.93,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,The attention to detail is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.02,0:27:51.19,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,You, the grieving granny, you're very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:55.40,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,Oh, look. Real tears. Do you get paid extra for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.49,0:27:59.40,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,Ahh, what we're all here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.49,0:28:03.03,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,I know! Why don't we take a look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.12,0:28:07.87,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,Oh, you've nailed it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:10.42,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.51,0:28:15.50,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,I know you're gonna come back in two weeks and dig it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:23.17,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,Now, what are you playing in this little vignette of deceit and villainy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:25.39,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,I'm the hearse driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.48,0:28:28.27,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,- You're the hearse driver? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.61,0:28:32.85,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,- You're the hearse driver? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.95,0:28:35.95,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,Ah!Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:39.49,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,There you are... Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.58,0:28:43.91,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,Uh, I do hope he hasn't made a nuisance of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:47.62,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,I'm Doctor, um...Bough,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:54.72,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,of the Lunatic Response Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:58.93,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Gunther here wasn't supposed to be released until 2028.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.02,0:29:01.85,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Gunther?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:06.40,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, there's been the most monumental cock- up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:11.03,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,Um, if you'll excuse me, with the deepest respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:13.44,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,utmost sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.54,0:29:16.24,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,Uh, he hasn't urinated on anyone, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.33,0:29:18.12,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,- No. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:22.54,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,That's a blessing. Are you gonna give me the gun, Gunther?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:32.00,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,There. That wasn't too difficult, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:36.35,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,Are you going to come home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.15,0:29:45.78,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,Oh... in the van! Yes, we are going in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:48.27,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. Vroom, vroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.57,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,- Vroom, vroom. Vroom, vroom. - Yes. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.66,0:29:56.21,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,Yes. He's waving good- bye. Good- bye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:29:58.70,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,- Good- bye. - Good- bye, Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:01.67,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,Mind the nice dead people. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.85,0:30:11.01,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,Oh, we'lljust go to the path here. There. Big step.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:14.55,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,It's a graveyard. It's where they bring people...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:16.80,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,Yes, all right. You can stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:20.81,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,- For appearances, I'll just hold your arm. - Just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:23.36,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,In fact, run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:33.25,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,I can't believe I've done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:37.63,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,I mean, I really cannot believe I've done this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.01,0:30:45.38,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,You see, 200 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:50.52,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,my family should have inherited the throne of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:53.47,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,but they were cast aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.57,0:30:56.93,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,Well, in a few very short days,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:31:00.28,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,it will be back where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:01.34,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.99,0:31:05.66,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.75,0:31:11.29,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,Shall I try it on? Yes? No? Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.38,0:31:15.46,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,To make you king, we need the archbishop of Canterbury to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.55,0:31:17.71,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,The archbishop of Canterbury...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.80,0:31:21.85,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,is being taken care of even as we speak. TARGET ACQUIRED
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.93,0:31:25.18,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.12,0:31:32.55,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:38.02,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,There's only one thing, sir. What are we going to do about English?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:44.95,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,If I were you, I wouldn't worry too much about English.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:48.82,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,He is no threat to us. I had his flat bugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.24,0:32:19.86,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,Clearly, the aptly named English is a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.96,0:32:23.62,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,He might be a fool, but he's a fool who keeps showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:27.79,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,Well, the next time he shows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:30.00,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.12,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.59,0:32:34.84,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,Dieter Klein and Klaus Vendetta, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.93,0:32:38.88,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,Released from prison six months ago. 327 convictions between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.98,0:32:41.10,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Armed robbery, grievous bodily harm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.19,0:32:43.59,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,and combined parking fines of more than 400...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.69,0:32:46.64,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, all right. Thank you, Bough. I think we get the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:50.02,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,The point is, sir, that Vendetta and Klein...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.11,0:32:53.65,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,are both in the employ of Monsieur Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:56.86,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,- Pascal Sauvage? - Precisely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.96,0:32:59.83,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,But you're not suggesting Sauvage is involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:02.08,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,I think he's more than just involved, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.17,0:33:04.63,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,I'm convinced he's up to his French neck in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.71,0:33:08.25,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd. Sauvage employs thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.34,0:33:11.59,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Just because two of them are villains doesn't mean that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.68,0:33:14.80,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,I want him discounted from this investigation immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:16.88,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:25.40,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,All right. Tonight I shall be at Sauvage's reception forthe new French ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:28.28,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,Any developments, you can reach me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:31.90,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,Apart from that, I don't want you within a hundred miles of the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.03,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:38.21,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Requisition order... MI7 quartermasters for immediate supply.,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.29,0:33:40.35,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,one military transport plane, fully fueled,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:42.42,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,with permission for nighttime city over flight
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.51,0:33:44.84,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,two night camouflage parachutes, plus reserves,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.84,0:33:47.17,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,plus neoprene bodysuits, twice, in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:49.55,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,I've never liked the navy blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:53.14,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,And a 40- inch chest for me 'cause I need the sleeve length.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.23,0:33:54.60,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,- Morning, Felch. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:57.18,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,Oh, and two Special Forces signet rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.27,0:33:59.27,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,primed and colour- coded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.36,0:34:02.03,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,- What's all this for? - For tonight's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.11,0:34:04.95,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,We're going to break into Sauvage's headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.03,0:34:07.41,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,- But Pegasus said... - Let me worry about Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:09.70,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,I know that Sauvage is behind all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:11.91,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,and tonight we're going to get the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:15.42,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,- Is something wrong, sir? - Did that sound like Felch to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.66,0:34:47.91,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,Bough
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.26,0:35:04.64,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,You, upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.33,0:35:21.32,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:55.77,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,He's on the upper level, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:59.12,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,He's on the upper level, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.71,0:36:06.70,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.93,0:36:17.22,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,And like a coiled viper... he strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.53,0:36:29.73,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,So what you're saying, sir, is there must have been two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:32.11,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,Oh, at least, Bough. Possibly four.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:34.32,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,I wonder why I didn't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.41,0:36:36.82,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,You mustn't dwell on your mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.91,0:36:40.28,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,- You must learn from them, then move on. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:44.42,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,- So where were you, sir? - Just drop it, Bough!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.51,0:36:51.80,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,- Aah! What is it, sir? - That bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:56.63,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,You get things sorted out for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:14.58,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,Well, well, we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:17.29,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,Mr English. What a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.38,0:37:19.50,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,I wondered when you might show up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.59,0:37:24.17,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,On the contrary, Miss Campbell. It is not I who keeps showing up. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.26,0:37:26.75,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,Do you like sushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.85,0:37:28.88,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.35,0:37:34.01,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,Oh, sushi! I practically live off the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.10,0:37:38.05,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,You might say the mysteries of the Orient are no mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.99,0:37:50.99,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,- Sake? - Ah. Sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:54.08,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:59.54,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,May all your daughters be born with three bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.93,0:38:09.40,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,Now then, perhaps you can explain how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:11.70,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,that I run into you at two crime scenes...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.71,0:38:15.60,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,and then can't find any record of you on a single government computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.61,0:38:17.90,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you ask the government that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:22.07,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,I am the government and I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:27.95,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.42,0:38:32.04,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,Mmm. You're brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.13,0:38:35.29,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,They say that sea urchin's the ultimate acquired taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.38,0:38:39.21,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,Hmm. It's a personal favourite of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:47.56,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,I think people are put off by how it feeds through its bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.65,0:38:49.97,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,Would you excuse me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.71,0:39:12.83,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Sorry. I'm from MI7. Sorry. I'm a secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:34.90,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,- Everything set, Bough? - Just about, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.99,0:39:39.28,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,Actually, sir, do you mind if I run through the plan one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.37,0:39:41.70,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,- No, no. - These are the two buildings here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.79,0:39:46.42,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,This one is ourtarget, Sauvage's headquarters, next to City Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:49.84,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,I jump first and land on the south side of the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:53.21,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,abseil down 14 floors and cut through this window here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.30,0:39:57.30,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,I then land on the east side and abseil down 12 floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:40:00.68,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,Where you wait for my signal that I've disabled the alarm system.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:03.34,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,- Yes. - You them break i nto this window here,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.44,0:40:06.23,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,work your way along the secure corridor and penetrate Sauvage's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:09.40,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,- Yes, yes. - Is that okay, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:12.57,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,It's been okay ever since I thought up the idea, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.95,0:40:19.99,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,Oh, I nearly forgot, sir. Your laser beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:23.12,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,- My what? - Your laser beacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.92,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,It'll guide you onto Sauvage's building.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.01,0:40:29.51,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,Your dependence on hardware really does amuse me, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.59,0:40:32.43,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,I've been dropped into the Kalahari Desert...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.51,0:40:37.06,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,carrying nothing more than a toothbrush and a packet of sherbet lemons,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:41.47,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,and I still found my way to Bulawayo before Ramadan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.57,0:40:45.56,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,So thank you, Bough, but no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.53,0:40:50.99,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,Bough, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.08,0:40:53.65,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,Geronimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.53,0:41:25.27,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,Fandango!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.31,0:41:51.85,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,Ai- yi- yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.45,0:41:59.86,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.43,0:42:18.96,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,Alarm's disabled, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.06,0:42:21.05,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,Roger that, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.46,0:42:52.19,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:56.06,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.60,0:43:00.60,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,This is worse than I thought, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.69,0:43:04.90,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,Sauvage has got some kind of laboratory set up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.99,0:43:08.15,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,God knows what kind of sick operation he's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.53,0:43:24.37,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,My God, what have they done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.45,0:43:27.78,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,They've taken some of my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.87,0:43:31.41,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,- Bastards! - It's only for tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.50,0:43:34.37,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,Of course it is. Come on, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.46,0:43:37.67,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,Let's get you out of here before they take anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.93,0:43:50.15,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,Good evening, Dr Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.23,0:43:52.35,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,Come on This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.44,0:43:55.31,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,Come on. I haven't got all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:58.40,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,And you, you angels of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.49,0:44:01.24,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,About turn. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.33,0:44:03.65,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,Come on, come on. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.75,0:44:07.28,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,Come on. Over there. I know what you're doing here. And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.37,0:44:10.58,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,Come on. Quicker. Quicker. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.05,0:44:14.92,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.01,0:44:18.13,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,perhaps you could direct me to your evil paymaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.22,0:44:20.00,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:22.76,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,You know exactly what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.85,0:44:26.90,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,Where is the office of Pascal Sauvage?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.84,0:44:54.96,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,Are you coming over here in a minute, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.31,0:44:59.13,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,I'm from MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:02.18,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,This has been a test of your emergency response systems,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.27,0:45:05.52,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,and I have to say you've all done extremely well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.61,0:45:08.86,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,Right. Well, I'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.94,0:45:11.02,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,And, uh, get well soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.58,0:45:20.87,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.60,0:45:41.93,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,Sir. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:52.20,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,Did you just land on the wrong building?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.29,0:45:56.20,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,I did a precautionary sweep of the immediate environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.29,0:45:58.37,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.59,0:46:02.04,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,- And everything was fine. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.13,0:46:04.34,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.47,0:46:14.26,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,I will be downstairs at the reception
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:25.06,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,- That's far enough. - Well, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.16,0:46:28.36,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,- Perhaps you'd like this as well. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.45,0:46:31.29,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,- Let me show you. - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.37,0:46:33.91,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,Well executed, Bough, but completely redundant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.00,0:46:37.20,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,- How do you mean, sir? - Super-strength muscle relaxant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.29,0:46:40.75,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,When he wakes up, he'll be as floppy as a damp old sock.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:48.80,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.45,0:47:07.07,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,That's the face of the archbishop of Canterbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.33,0:47:13.17,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.13,0:47:20.55,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,What's this got to do with the Crown Jewels?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:27.53,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.49,0:47:44.57,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.27,0:48:04.31,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,English.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.39,0:48:07.26,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,A people whose empire once covered...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.36,0:48:10.81,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,one quarter of the surface of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.90,0:48:13.27,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,Alas, no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:16.65,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,My friends ask me, "Pascal, how can you be so interested...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.74,0:48:20.99,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,in such a backward, grotty little country?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.08,0:48:23.91,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,My answer is simple.. the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.00,0:48:27.95,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,The queen has more power in hertiny white gloves...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.05,0:48:31.63,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,than any other head of state in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.72,0:48:34.09,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,She can declare war or make peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.18,0:48:36.55,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,and most intriguingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.64,0:48:41.51,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,she can seiZe any piece of land which takes her fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.60,0:48:45.47,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,Ofcourse, the queen never uses...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.57,0:48:48.35,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,the enormous power afforded to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:53.15,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,But imagine someone who would use that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.24,0:48:56.91,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,Imagine, say, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.99,0:49:01.21,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,But how could he do that, sir? How could he make himself king?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.29,0:49:03.45,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,The archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.14,0:49:15.21,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.52,0:49:20.14,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,Hands up. There's a good fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.23,0:49:22.06,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,Heavily armed for a late night at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.15,0:49:26.64,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,You fool, English. You'll never get out of the building alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.74,0:49:29.03,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,I'd save your breath for my questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.11,0:49:31.07,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.16,0:49:32.90,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,Incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:36.11,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Sodium pentothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.21,0:49:39.74,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,I won't lie to you. It's a truth serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.84,0:49:44.54,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,Now then, why does Sauvage want to have himself crowned?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.63,0:49:47.97,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,You have no idea what's going on here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.05,0:49:51.17,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,It would be funny if it wasn't so...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.26,0:49:52.64,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:01.98,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,- He's talking gibberish, sir. - I can hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.15,0:50:07.16,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,- He's collapsed onto me, sir. - I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.24,0:50:10.66,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,- You don't think you could've got the syringes mixed up? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.75,0:50:13.70,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,Given the guard outside truth serum and given Klein the muscle relaxant?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.79,0:50:15.78,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.88,0:50:20.37,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, Bough. I think I know my right from my left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.46,0:50:23.58,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,- Sir? - Oh, bugger it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.18,0:50:27.22,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,Bough, take "flodd."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.31,0:50:31.43,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,- Take what, sir? - Flodd, "Schlage."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.52,0:50:35.02,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,- I'm not quite getting that second word, sir. - Schlaaaagh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:37.10,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,- Write it down, sir. - Schlaaaagh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.19,0:50:40.31,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.66,0:50:44.23,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,C. C- A- Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.32,0:50:48.24,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,Car! Take the car! We came by plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.33,0:50:51.20,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,Bugger off!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.29,0:50:53.58,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.67,0:50:57.20,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,- What's wrong with them? - I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.30,0:51:00.21,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,Wrong answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.30,0:51:02.54,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,What is it with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.64,0:51:04.96,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.39,0:51:08.10,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.19,0:51:10.18,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,Sorry, but who are you, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.27,0:51:12.98,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,Special Agent Campbell. I'm attached to Interpol in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.07,0:51:15.35,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,We've been watching Sauvage for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.44,0:51:17.44,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:20.73,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,Because every major convict released from a Sauvage prison in six months...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.82,0:51:23.07,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,has been employed by one of his companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.16,0:51:25.62,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,We believe he's recruiting them for a major criminal conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.71,0:51:28.41,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,We just don't know what yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:32.08,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,- What did he say? - Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.17,0:51:34.54,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,We have to report to Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.63,0:51:36.67,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,Oh, no, sir. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:39.88,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,- How do we get out of here? - Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.97,0:51:42.76,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,How do we get out of here? Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.85,0:51:47.26,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry about that. How do we get out of here without being seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.35,0:51:50.14,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.23,0:51:51.52,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,Left by the fountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.52,0:51:52.81,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,right by the fire exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.81,0:51:54.10,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,to the elevator at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.20,0:51:56.60,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:58.44,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,Nice job, Bough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:01.45,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,Left, sir. Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.54,0:52:04.62,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,Sir, you can't go to Sauvage's reception in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.71,0:52:07.62,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,The effect of the drug has practically worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.71,0:52:09.67,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,I'm "fline"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.76,0:52:12.00,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,schline... uh, "gline"...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.14,0:52:24.68,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,- Monsieur. - Ah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.82,0:52:31.11,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,- Would you like another? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.49,0:52:39.32,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.71,0:52:46.87,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,What in God's name...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.96,0:52:49.00,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,Ah, Foreign "Sebretarary."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.09,0:52:51.63,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,Um
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.72,0:52:53.63,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.72,0:52:57.09,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,hall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:50.12,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. I'm very sorry to interrupt...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.20,0:53:52.33,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,Pascal, how nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.41,0:53:55.03,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,- Enjoying the party? - Oh, splendid affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.12,0:54:00.25,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,I was until I was informed that your man English...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.34,0:54:03.29,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,and his curious boyfriend here have spent the evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.38,0:54:06.92,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,breaking into my office and assaulting my staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.01,0:54:10.30,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,- Is this true, Bough? - Well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.74,0:54:23.03,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,What do you think you're up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.11,0:54:25.98,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,- Sir, if I could just offe - Go home, Bough!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.08,0:54:27.90,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.00,0:54:30.62,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,I gave you direct orders not to meddle with Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.71,0:54:31.86,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.86,0:54:33.01,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,Break into his office
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.01,0:54:34.16,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,and assault two of his staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.25,0:54:35.72,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,Then you march in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.72,0:54:37.19,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,loaded with God knows what,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.19,0:54:38.67,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,and insult the foreign secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.76,0:54:41.59,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,I haven't encountered such behaviour in Whitehall in 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.68,0:54:44.59,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,- But - There are no "buts, " English.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.68,0:54:48.30,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,You're off the case. Your security clearance is hereby cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.39,0:54:51.76,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,After a three- month leave of absence, you will return at your old grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.86,0:54:54.98,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,And I hope never to hear your name again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.79,0:55:50.20,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,English has seen too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.30,0:55:52.79,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,We go to plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.88,0:55:55.29,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,Get rid of the fake archbishop...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.39,0:55:58.30,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,and green- light the visit to Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:56:02.22,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,Then this pathetic country can humiliate itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.31,0:56:04.98,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,by crowning me officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.66,0:56:20.91,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.17,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,That's a letter of abdication...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.26,0:56:35.25,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,renouncing your claims to the throne...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:38.43,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,and the claims of your entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.52,0:56:40.51,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,Sign it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.12,0:56:47.29,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.57,0:56:50.65,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.79,0:57:05.38,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.47,0:57:07.01,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,Prime Minister, sorry to call so late,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.01,0:57:08.55,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid the queen is abdicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:10.34,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.43,0:57:14.84,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,Abdicated? But that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.14,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,I only wish that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.23,0:57:21.36,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,- Let me talk to her. Maybe she just... - Pascal, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.44,0:57:24.19,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,My people have spent the last 10 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.28,0:57:27.86,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,trying to track down the rightful heir to the throne...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.95,0:57:31.20,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,and they've come up with a name, which they've double- checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.29,0:57:33.78,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.87,0:57:36.99,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,- It's you. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:44.42,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,In the wake of the return of the Crown Jewels...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.51,0:57:46.55,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,to a police station in North London,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.64,0:57:49.39,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,Pascal Sauvage has requested that his coronation...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.47,0:57:52.01,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,take place this Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.10,0:57:55.40,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,In the House, the prime minister said he was looking forward to the ceremony...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.41,0:57:58.69,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,and he believed that Monsieur Sauvage will make a fine king...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.78,0:58:03.60,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,and will bring all that is best about modern Europe to our ancient institutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.12,0:58:13.79,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,Get your car keys. We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.88,0:58:17.04,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,- Miss Campbell. - Sauvage is heading back to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:21.79,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,He's invited 13 of the richest criminal masterminds in the world to meet him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.89,0:58:25.34,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Campbell. I'm off the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.64,0:58:27.01,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,It's been reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.10,0:58:29.77,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,I know. Reassigned to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.44,0:58:36.15,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,- I want you with me. - Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:40.02,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,Are you gonna sit here in this grotty flat feeling sorry foryourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.11,0:58:43.36,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,Or are you gonna get out there and save your country?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.58,0:58:46.90,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sit in the flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.00,0:58:51.08,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,- Johnny, this is ridiculous. - I'm a spent force.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.84,0:58:55.67,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,Spent, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.55,0:59:02.38,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:06.13,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,Will... you... please... stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.08,0:59:21.15,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,I'll just be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.36,0:59:33.92,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.22,0:59:43.47,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.38,1:00:10.04,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,It'll be nightfall in an hour. Then we can strike out for the chateau.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.13,1:00:13.38,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,The fact is, the moment Sauvage gets that crown on his head,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.47,1:00:16.72,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,he'll be able to do whatever he likes with the country that I love,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.81,1:00:19.56,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,and that is why you and I have got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.35,1:00:25.02,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,- Relishing the thought? - Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.99,1:00:31.74,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,I suppose you've made love to lots of women, haven't you, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.49,1:00:38.24,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,Uh Uh, well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.33,1:00:41.04,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,one does one's best.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.50,1:00:44.33,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:49.46,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,Well, it's been three years since my fiance left me,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.55,1:00:53.39,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,and since then I haven't made love to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.47,1:00:55.38,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,But then I met you...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:00:59.69,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,and I felt this... hunger...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.77,1:01:03.02,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,deep down inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.11,1:01:06.31,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,I wanted to say things to you, I wanted to do things to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.41,1:01:10.95,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,that I haven't wanted to do in a very, very, very long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:17.83,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,What, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.92,1:01:20.79,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,What sort of things are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:23.80,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,Things like punching you in the face,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.88,1:01:27.25,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,kicking you in the backside for being such a pompous, know- nothing asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.35,1:01:31.64,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,But then I started to see beyond the idiot that everybody else saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.73,1:01:34.76,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,I started to see the man on the inside...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.85,1:01:36.91,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,who was determined to do his duty,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.91,1:01:38.98,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,no matter what or who lay in his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.07,1:01:43.02,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,And I began to feel other things for him,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.11,1:01:47.94,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,to want to do other things for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.04,1:01:50.49,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Things...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.58,1:01:54.36,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,involving plastic toys and soft cheese?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.46,1:01:59.17,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,- What? - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.26,1:02:03.72,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,You're toying with me. You're telling me to stop in the gentlest way you know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:05.88,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,No. N- N- No...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.97,1:02:07.63,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,You're such a special person...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.73,1:02:10.93,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,not to take advantage of me while I'm vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.02,1:02:13.56,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,- No...  Well - So thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:15.94,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,for being such a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.49,1:02:20.78,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.31,1:02:44.76,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking, Miss Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.77,1:02:48.60,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,If we don't pull this off, God knows what might happen to England.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:52.10,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,Actually, I was thinking there must be a betterway in than that pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.23,1:02:54.40,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,Well, there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:58.48,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,I've analysed it from every angle, and this is the best option.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.57,1:03:02.36,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,I'll go in first, and if it's a clear way through, I'll call down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:06.16,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.25,1:03:09.54,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,- Be careful. - I'm always careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:11.50,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:04.48,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.57,1:04:06.44,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,In a few hours time...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:09.20,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,I will become the next king of England.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.72,1:04:29.21,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.61,1:04:49.48,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,- How did you get here? - Up the ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.58,1:04:52.11,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together. It's only a bit of poo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.33,1:04:59.50,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, it's cold! It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.96,1:05:01.71,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,What is the one commodity...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.80,1:05:06.67,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,the world never seems to run out of?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.76,1:05:08.88,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,Criminals, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.97,1:05:11.26,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,Lawbreakers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.35,1:05:15.10,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,Every nation in the world struggles...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.19,1:05:17.94,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,with the issue of overcrowded prisons.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.02,1:05:23.36,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,So, what do we do with all these villains?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.45,1:05:26.48,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,Find the solution to that problem...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.58,1:05:30.95,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,and the governments of the world would pay you through their nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:35.30,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I have found a solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.38,1:05:41.30,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,We empty every prison on the entire planet,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:46.59,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,we take the resulting tidal wave of human scum...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.68,1:05:49.35,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,and we put it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.90,1:05:56.40,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,The moment I am crowned king,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.48,1:05:59.19,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,I will turn England into the largest prison...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.28,1:06:02.15,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,in the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.41,1:06:07.07,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,210, 000 square miles...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.16,1:06:09.32,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,of prime real estate...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.42,1:06:13.12,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,conveniently separated from true civilization...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:15.45,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,by 20 miles of ocean...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.55,1:06:17.79,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,- and soon to be available... - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:23.84,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,for the entire world to dump its human waste in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.93,1:06:26.01,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,According to current projections,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.10,1:06:32.02,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,we will not run out of prison space for the next 500 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.11,1:06:36.19,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,So, toni ght one, and only one, of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.28,1:06:41.36,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,So, tonight one, and only one, of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.45,1:06:43.86,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,of this venture.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.96,1:06:48.87,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,So that's his little game. We must get hold of that DVD.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:52.08,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,But how, Johnny? There's only two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.17,1:06:54.41,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,You're young, Miss Campbell, and inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.51,1:06:56.83,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,What you seem to have forgotten is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.93,1:06:59.40,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,nobody knows we are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.40,1:07:03.97,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,At our disposal we have the vital element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:07.15,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,Now, my plan is simple but effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.23,1:07:10.00,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,I shall drop from the gallery at this end of the room
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.02,1:07:11.81,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,and take Sauvage prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.90,1:07:13.95,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,You will then enter from the far door,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.95,1:07:16.00,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,cutting off any means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.05,1:07:18.56,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,Then, using Sauvage as a hostage,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.56,1:07:21.07,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,we'll get the hell out of here. Clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.59,1:07:31.88,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,Get 'em up, you French ponce.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.97,1:07:36.51,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,But, Mr English, I'm gobsmacked!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.60,1:07:39.09,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,What an unexpected surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.18,1:07:42.80,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,Surprises are very much my speciality, Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.06,1:07:46.85,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,I think we've seen enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.94,1:07:53.78,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you're planning, and I'm here to put a stop to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.87,1:07:58.61,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,My bottom will be king of England before you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.71,1:08:00.70,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,Wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.79,1:08:04.00,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd care to look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.09,1:08:06.41,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.55,1:08:11.63,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,Lorna!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.43,1:08:16.51,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.60,1:08:20.52,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,Well, I'm afraid that we'll have to...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.61,1:08:23.31,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,conclude the floor show for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.40,1:08:25.23,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.32,1:08:29.82,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,You may have taken me, but you'll never take England.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.91,1:08:32.70,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,Not as long as I have breath in my body...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.79,1:08:35.08,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,or a bullet in my gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.22,1:08:48.88,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,You know, Mr English, I'm going to miss you. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.97,1:08:51.21,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,You're very entertaining. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.31,1:08:52.97,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.65,1:08:59.39,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,Good morning, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.48,1:09:01.64,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,and welcome to the breakfast show.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.03,1:09:07.28,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,As the crowds are gathering here for the crowning of our first French king...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.37,1:09:09.49,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,since the year 1066,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.58,1:09:14.54,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,call here at London FM with the top ten things you most love about the French.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.63,1:09:18.08,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,We haven 't had any calls yet, uh, at all,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.17,1:09:21.71,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,but the lines are still open and I'll give you that number again...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.80,1:09:24.92,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,Zero, deux, Zero, sept...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.60,1:09:29.80,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,This is not good, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:32.05,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,We've got to think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.81,1:09:37.06,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.15,1:09:38.78,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,Hop! Hop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.86,1:09:42.61,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,And hop! And hop! And stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.70,1:09:45.15,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,Now, are you familiar...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.24,1:09:48.94,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,with the shaman throat warblers of the Guatemalan delta?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.04,1:09:50.41,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.50,1:09:52.49,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,It has long been their belief...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.59,1:09:56.63,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,that a whistle pitched at the precise resonant frequency of a metal lock...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.72,1:10:00.80,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,will vibrate the levers in such a way that the door will simply swing open.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.89,1:10:02.76,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.85,1:10:05.80,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,And kneel.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.77,1:10:11.69,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,Right. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.12,1:10:27.41,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,- I can't hear anything. - I'm into ultrasonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.50,1:10:30.42,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,Will you just stop all this and face facts?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.50,1:10:34.25,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,We've failed. The only thing that can save us now is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.14,1:10:42.80,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.89,1:10:45.64,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,- Ohh! - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.86,1:10:56.90,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,I don't know why you hauled yourself up that dreadful poo tube, Bough,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.99,1:11:00.78,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,when there was a perfectly good ladder right beside it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.87,1:11:03.28,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,Now, Sauvage may have fooled the country...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.37,1:11:06.13,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,with his fake archbishop and his secret agenda,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.21,1:11:08.58,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,but he hasn't fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.01,1:11:12.54,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,So, here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.45,1:12:47.44,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,Sirs, you are hereby called to witness the anointing...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.53,1:12:53.82,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,of your one true lord and future king Pascal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.92,1:12:57.96,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,Pascal, are you willing to take the oath?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.05,1:13:01.46,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,I am willing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.55,1:13:05.05,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,Then be thou anointed...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.14,1:13:08.92,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,with this holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.31,1:13:15.64,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,And do you, the chosen bishops of England, Scotland and Wales,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.73,1:13:18.57,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,ascent to this anointing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.65,1:13:21.19,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,For Scotland, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.28,1:13:22.99,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,For Wales, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.91,1:13:26.94,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,For England, I do not!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.04,1:13:30.79,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,English!?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.09,1:13:37.75,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,That man must not be crowned king because he is...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.84,1:13:40.63,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,a fraudster, a charlatan and a thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.72,1:13:44.34,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,No, please. Let him speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.18,1:13:49.18,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,It is this man, Pascal Sauvage,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.27,1:13:52.47,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,who stole the Crown Jewels,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.57,1:13:54.77,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,who forced the queen to abdicate...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.86,1:13:58.77,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,and who would kill anyone who got in his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.86,1:14:00.82,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,It is the end, Herr English.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.54,1:14:06.03,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,He has cheated, conned and manipulated...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.12,1:14:08.88,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,this great country for his own ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.96,1:14:11.28,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,He's fooled you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.30,1:14:16.75,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,What's more, this whole ceremony is a sham...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.84,1:14:20.43,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,because that man standing in front of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.51,1:14:23.68,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,is not the archbishop of Canterbury.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.15,1:14:29.98,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,English, a word of advice: Don't go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.07,1:14:34.61,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,Shut it, Frenchy. I'll go wherever I damn well please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:38.20,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,- Now take it off. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.28,1:14:41.65,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,Your face is made of plastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.33,1:14:45.29,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,Remove it at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.38,1:14:47.87,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.96,1:14:52.01,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,Right. I'll just have to remove it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.09,1:14:56.30,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.39,1:14:59.67,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,Maybe it pulls up from the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.77,1:15:02.22,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,Come on, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.58,1:15:20.12,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,- Aaah! - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.92,1:15:23.96,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,Must be a join here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.04,1:15:26.96,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,Fascinating performance as always, Monsieur English,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.05,1:15:29.67,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid we must move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.76,1:15:34.14,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,Nobody's moving anywhere until I'm finished with this piece of low- life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.22,1:15:37.26,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Do you or do you you not...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.35,1:15:40.55,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,have tattooed on your bottom the words,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.65,1:15:43.68,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,"Jesus is coming... look busy?"
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:47.82,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.91,1:15:50.15,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,Well, let's find out, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.24,1:15:52.91,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,Go on, over. Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.05,1:16:04.37,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.68,1:16:17.76,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,All right, so I was wrong about the archbishop's bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.57,1:16:22.35,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,- But there's more. - But not, I'm afraid, today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.44,1:16:24.90,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,Sergeant, please take this man away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.99,1:16:28.69,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,- But be gentle with him. - Do you think that's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.78,1:16:31.19,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,You think I don't have more evidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.29,1:16:34.74,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,My loyal subordinate is standing by with a DVD...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.83,1:16:38.45,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,which shows Sauvage's hideous plans forthis country.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.55,1:16:40.75,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,Get him out! Get him out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.84,1:16:44.71,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,- Play it, Bough! Play the disk! - Play it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.26,1:17:04.57,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,∮ You're so hot teasing me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.66,1:17:10.49,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,∮ So you're blue, but I can't take a chance on a chick like you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.58,1:17:13.73,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,∮ It's somethin' I couldn't do ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.74,1:17:18.85,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,∮ Well, I can dance with you, honey if you think it's funny ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.94,1:17:21.61,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,∮ Doesyour mother know that you're out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.70,1:17:25.24,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,∮ And I could shout with you, baby Flirt a little, maybe ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.34,1:17:28.33,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,∮ Doesyour mother know that you're out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.42,1:17:31.01,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,∮ Take it easy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:33.37,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,∮ Better slow down, girl That's no way to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.46,1:17:36.81,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,∮ Doesyour mother know ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.50,1:17:47.82,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,- Oi! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.01,1:17:58.21,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,Well, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.81,1:18:08.10,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,Then as Solomon was anointed king...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.19,1:18:12.52,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,by Zadok the priest and Nathan the prophet,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.61,1:18:16.06,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,so be thou anointed...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.16,1:18:18.07,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,and consecrated king...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.87,1:18:23.45,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,over all the peoples... whom the Lord thy God...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.54,1:18:25.53,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,hath given thee to govern...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.63,1:18:29.12,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,and of all your possessions,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.21,1:18:32.58,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,wherever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.68,1:18:34.58,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.68,1:18:39.05,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,And so, in the name of the Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.14,1:18:40.80,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,and of the Son...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.89,1:18:42.89,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,and of the Holy Ghost,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.94,1:18:47.18,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,I crown you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.78,1:18:53.61,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.70,1:18:55.78,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,- Give it back! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.87,1:18:57.78,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,- That is my crown! - Never!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.87,1:19:01.41,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,- Give it back! - Never in a million years, Sauvage!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.50,1:19:03.46,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,- Give it to me! - Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.54,1:19:06.25,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,Merde!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.63,1:19:10.09,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.84,1:19:13.80,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,- Stop! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:19.77,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,All this stupid little country have to do is stand in line...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.85,1:19:23.30,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,and do what it's told for one miserable day!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.40,1:19:25.30,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,But can it do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.40,1:19:29.64,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,My fragrant French ass, it can!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.45,1:19:36.30,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,Merde!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.04,1:19:40.58,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.92,1:19:44.96,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,Give it! The crown, eh? The crown! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.14,1:19:52.51,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,And so, in the name of the Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.60,1:19:55.05,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,and of the Son and of the Holy Ghost,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.27,1:19:57.81,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,I crown you...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.82,1:20:02.69,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,king.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.78,1:20:04.85,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.81,1:20:34.89,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,Arrest that man...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.98,1:20:37.14,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,and lock him away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.50,1:21:29.37,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,Words can hardly expressjust how much we appreciate everything you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.46,1:21:31.87,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,Nothing more than my duty, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.96,1:21:37.09,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,And in return, is there anything that your queen and country can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.18,1:21:39.38,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.47,1:21:43.47,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,since one is asking, ma'am
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.56,1:21:46.76,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,In celebration of her return to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.85,1:21:49.89,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,the queen has declaredAugust 5 a national holiday...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.98,1:21:54.61,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,and has conferred a knighthood on the unnamed MI7 agent...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:58.86,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,responsible for foiling the plot of French businessman Pascal Sauvage.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.95,1:22:01.57,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,Mr Sauvage is now awaiting trial for high treason,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.66,1:22:03.90,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,a crime which still carries the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.00,1:22:07.60,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,If found guilty, he's asked that his brain be donated to medical science...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.54,1:22:11.54,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,to further research into the causes ofhyper manic schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.63,1:22:14.20,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the unnamed English agent has left the country...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:18.43,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,and has already embarked on his next challenging mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.35,1:22:24.39,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.48,1:22:26.72,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,Sir Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.82,1:22:29.69,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,Her Majesty did seem very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.32,1:22:33.48,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,She's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.13,1:22:45.38,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,Mmm. You are full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:53.13,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.22,1:22:56.89,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,- Johnny! - Oh, f...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.32,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,啊哈，H&K公司的 G- 36突击枪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.69,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,在合适的人手里非常致命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:02.01,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,啊，一号特工
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:07.31,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,我一直期待这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:12.03,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,这样啊，我尽量不让你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:17.24,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,你高估了你自己的力量，你比女人强不了多少，英格力先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.37,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,我得说，那实际上不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:38.47,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,长官？长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.34,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,长官，找到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:46.22,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 任务档案，一号特工今晚要出发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:50.95,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,是的，任务档案应该在这里 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.70,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,一号特工
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.66,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.00,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,我是来拿档案的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:09.42,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,大宝，一号特工的档案请拿给他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.26,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.47,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,您的任务档案，一号特工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:21.43,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,包括潜水艇舱门的密码，我已经亲自试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:24.31,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.00,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,那么，今夜就只到法国
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.56,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,还是要一直穿过比利牛斯山？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:33.53,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你，就不得不杀你灭口了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:37.95,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:43.55,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,哦，好的，好的，我希望你能够
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.63,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,加油啊，一号特工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:48.92,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,祝你好运，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:55.43,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,真经典，真与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:58.02,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,(所有军情七处注意了 紧急情况)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.23,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,(一号特工在比亚丽兹执行任务时遇害)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:03.94,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,(潜水艇舱门没能打开)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:09.28,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,英国有史以来最伟大的特工转眼间就毙命了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:12.24,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:16.41,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,你知道为什么全世界都嫉妒我们吗，大宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:20.42,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,- 我们总是有后备特工随时接替 - 绝对正确，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.96,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,他们现在都聚集在墓地周围
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:28.52,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,在他们如此悲痛的时候，保护他们是我们莫大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:32.77,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,他们的性命就掌握在我们手里了，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.58,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,一切正常吗，英格力？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:48.53,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,长官，你会发现一切比正常还正常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:52.70,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,你现在进入的是全英国最安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:02.72,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,柏伽索斯，我们正面临一场国家危机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.83,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,很明显一号特工发现了一些线索
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:06.85,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,我们必须找出来是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.97,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,我需要再派一名特工，现在还有谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:13.40,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,一个都没了，首相，他们在爆炸中都遇害了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.86,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,全部？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:18.70,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,呃，幸运的是，还有一名幸存者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.11,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,《憨豆特工》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:43.69,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,（王牌间谍指南）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.29,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,（潘格斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.28,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:20.46,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,强尼·英格力 我是来见柏伽索斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:23.88,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.63,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,见面前，你还得签收一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.76,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,这是你新的视网膜身份识别卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:36.10,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,这是你的第九级通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.44,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,请签上名字和日期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.73,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.57,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,哦，让我想起了老式的耐用圆珠笔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:49.19,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,我记得每个特工都会带一只这样的笔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:52.62,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,没经过训练的人一点也看不出异样，但按两下这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.83,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,啊，英格力，你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.96,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,见到我的秘书了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:05.38,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,嗯，她出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:10.31,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,嗯，我们是不是该…？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:17.61,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,一号特工相信有人阴谋盗取王室珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.94,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,刚刚有人赞助了几百万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.24,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,对他们进行了修复
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:26.86,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,今晚将在伦敦塔展示给世人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:31.25,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,女王坚持按计划举行典礼，所以我们要你…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:37.46,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,哈！ 谁… 谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:40.26,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,谁是赞助人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.75,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,派斯卡·苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.88,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,什么，那个装模作样的拥有几间监狱的法国佬？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:49.39,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,苏瓦吉拥有70亿英镑的帝国，英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:52.52,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,在60个国家开了400多间监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:55.15,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,- 他在这里建了25间 - 是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.99,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,天哪，他还和王室有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:00.63,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,依照首相的看法而言
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:03.20,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,他是英格兰最好的朋友之一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:09.12,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,现在，英格力，我要你今晚到伦敦塔，去监视揭幕仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.83,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,保安措施上的任何缺口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:14.79,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,不管多细微，都必须立刻堵上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.34,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,明白我的意思了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:19.51,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,- 十分清楚，长官 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.43,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,- 哦，好的 - 呃，英格力…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:26.22,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,再也不能出什么篓子了，特别是今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:31.11,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,我的字典里没有“篓子”这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:35.40,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,（伦敦塔）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.24,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,车子很棒，先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:53.34,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,英格力先生，上校安东尼·切文尼克斯爵士，皇家安全主管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.42,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,晚上好，上校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:58.47,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,- 按照我的要求在屋顶上布置狙击手了吗？ - 布置了13个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:01.60,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,- 窗子呢？ - 都换成防弹不破碎的玻璃了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.73,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,我现在要混到客人中去，不让人注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:11.90,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,- 女王陛下驾到请通知我 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.70,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,我该和你在一起吗，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:17.99,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,哦，是的， 大宝 你先检查屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.77,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,救命！救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.90,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:48.02,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,你也好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.03,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,强尼·英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:53.74,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,萝娜·坎贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.75,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,一杯血腥玛丽 ，但别太辣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:00.50,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,你来这里是因为工作上的需要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.96,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,我是珠宝修复人员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:06.08,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,- 很有趣 - 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:09.96,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你，我就得杀你灭口了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:12.35,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,那你试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:21.48,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,苏瓦吉先生，我谨代表女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:23.86,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,欢迎您光临
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.52,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,谢谢，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.44,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,你是一个人来的 英格力先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:31.70,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,我只能选择孤身一人，坎贝尔小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.67,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,女人需要安全，有保障，而我只能带来危险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.67,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,有些女人觉得危险很有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:42.92,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,像你这样的女人吗，坎贝尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:48.01,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,我这样的女人就期待你这样的男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.34,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,自己找出答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:53.27,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.23,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:12:00.98,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,哦，是给我的 你能帮我弄些奶酪玉米粒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:03.53,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,我们说到哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.57,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,很显然，你还没见过我们的主人苏瓦吉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.82,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,不，感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:13.66,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,我宁愿坐在仙人掌上，…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.51,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,也不愿和那个法国暴发户说笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:21.72,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,据我所知，法国人唯一该招待的就是入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:25.97,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:29.72,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,派斯卡·苏瓦吉，法国暴发户
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.93,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,萝娜·坎贝尔 我非常期待见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:35.69,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,[法语] 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:38.98,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,哦！ 你是强尼·英格力 久仰，久仰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.74,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,私下说说，我自己也不喜欢法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:45.83,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,别告诉别人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:49.25,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,我来帮你去找奶酪玉米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.33,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,- 不，不，不，我… - 让我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.33,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,法国人都是天生的侍者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.63,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,- 世界上最好的 - 嗯，但 …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.92,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,- 在这儿等着，让我来招待你 - 不，实际上…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:02.35,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,不，请你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:06.64,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,这些法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:12.15,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,真是非常…呃… 是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:31.09,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,女士们先生们， [法语] 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:35.84,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,欢迎，欢迎光临今晚这个重要的场合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.80,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,我们所在的伦敦塔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:42.05,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,是世界上最著名的监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:45.73,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,这些奇妙的珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.02,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,被安全得锁在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.95,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,我要感谢你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.32,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,给我这次美妙的机会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:59.04,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,为修复这些珠宝捐款
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:03.62,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,就像我们法国人说的:“好上加好”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.25,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,多美妙的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:32.16,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,是切文尼克斯上校！ 他受伤了，谁伤了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.86,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,刺客跑到里面去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:38.41,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,大宝，你守住门口
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:42.20,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,啊哈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:48.42,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,天哪，大宝，别进来，那家伙是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.88,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,你吓不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:54.22,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,没打到！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:27.01,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,我已经制服刺客了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:31.35,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,恐慌过去了，一切都在控制中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.35,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,谢谢，女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.31,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,我们该镇定下来，等待女王陛下的光临…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.61,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,现在回到我们伟大国家…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:49.16,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,无与伦比的王室珠宝这里来，它们刚刚被修复
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.41,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,我知道，我也有这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:58.00,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,我们这个岛国的象征
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:16:02.01,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,离我们如此近，伸手可及…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:07.68,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,女王陛下驾到，肃静
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:10.85,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,哦，珠宝在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.23,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,真是彻头彻尾的灾难，英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.19,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,完全同意，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:20.06,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,我们得夺回珠宝，英格力，越快越好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:24.67,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,告诉我刺客的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.43,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,在他们搜查房间时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:28.20,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,没有找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:31.21,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,那家伙明显是个职业杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:34.50,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,他一定是在女王来的时候溜走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:37.63,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,但他是唯一的线索，我们必须找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:41.88,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,进来，这是… 这是数据部门的罗杰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:45.14,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,请坐，他将根据你的描述画一张模拟图
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:48.64,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,告诉我们那人长什么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:51.85,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,嗯，唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:55.19,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,他… 个头大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:17:01.32,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,- 头发的颜色？ - 嗯…桔色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:04.58,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,- 桔色？ - 嗯，卷发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.45,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,嗯，实际上是紧紧卷曲的的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:11.08,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,- 卷得很紧 - 有个眼罩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.79,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,鼻子断了，牙齿不多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:17.21,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,最多两颗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.72,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,面颊上有道伤疤…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:25.22,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,香蕉形状
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:29.36,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,- 哪一边？ - 两边都有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:32.36,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,几乎在中间连到了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.57,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,你确信吗，英格力？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:47.16,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,哦，是的，就是这样，太像了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:51.63,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,为什么，就像他就在这屋里一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:18:01.86,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,哇，看啊，长官，全套的铃声和汽笛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.94,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,别关心这些小玩意儿，把注意力放到案子上来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:15.20,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,（请勿停车  违规者强行拖吊）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.79,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,早上好，先生们，多谢等我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:28.34,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,今早我们面临的只有一个简单的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:33.01,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,就是，盗贼是如何进入如此高度保安的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.43,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,然后又带着珠宝逃跑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:41.52,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,问题很简单，我相信答案却很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:44.86,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,- 实际上，长官… - 大宝 我在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:47.95,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,你们必须知道，先生们，在一个高明的罪犯眼里…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:52.41,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,看到的不是一间房间，而是一连串的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.87,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,我该从窗子进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.95,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:01.59,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,- 我该从天花板落下来吗？ - 实际上，长官…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:05.59,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,只有一件事情可以确信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.35,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,他们不是从地板下进来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.64,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,我扶住你了，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:13.51,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,没关系，朝我这边来，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:17.39,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,- 那我就要跨过地洞了，长官 - 没必要恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.03,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,见到底了吗，大宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.07,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,还没有，下面越来越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:28.40,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,我有点担心会被卡住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:32.54,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,相信我，大宝 不会的，继续下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.42,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,是，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.46,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,我没事，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:42.01,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,到底了吗，大宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:44.63,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,没，我实际上被卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:48.47,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,哦，上帝，大宝 别动，我下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:51.81,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是个好主意，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.73,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.82,0:19:57.36,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,小心，长官！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.15,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.00,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:13.21,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧，长官？ - 是的，我脚下某个柔软的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:16.09,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,- 你脚下是我，长官 - 哦，很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.55,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,现在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:22.51,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,只能肯定的是，会不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.68,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,但这一定通向某处
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.93,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,我在黑的地方有点不舒服，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:29.26,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,没什么可担心的，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.72,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,也许一片漆黑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.08,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,但我们还是能看见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.44,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,能吗，长官？ 怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:36.32,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,阿尔马格来伯山上的贝多因僧人…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.81,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,发明了一种声波圣歌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.66,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,- 我明白了，长官 - 他们的歌声…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:43.99,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,遇到障碍物会反弹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.37,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,用他们高度音准的耳朵…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.30,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,他们能在脑子里面形成前面道路的图像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.58,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,- 太棒了，长官 - 但，你的歌声必须保持降E调
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:21:00.00,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,∮ E音调，E音调，E音调 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:04.75,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,∮ 感谢你，这音乐，也感谢我所吟唱的歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:06.96,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,- 有效吗，长官？ - 很好，谢谢你，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.78,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,∮ 感谢所有的欢乐，因为… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:15.23,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,你没事吗，长官？ 我想我看见了，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.86,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,哦，好啊，继续
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:38.93,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,这是个长的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.14,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,长的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.27,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.44,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我们要叫支援吗，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:54.53,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,什么？ 看着那些胖警察来代替我们逮捕他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.61,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,我可不这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:03.33,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,早上好， 军情七处 为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:08.38,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,看看，大宝，这些迟钝无能的家伙，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:12.72,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,他们的脑子永远达不到我们这种专家级的水准
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:04.07,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 我们现在怎么办，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:06.23,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,好好学着点，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.44,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,他们在我们前面太远了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:14.46,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,有点信心，大宝 他们往南去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:26.09,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,- 他们在那儿，长官！ - 不出所料
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:33.48,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,抓好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:43.73,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,开这车永远赶不上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.83,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,- 你来开，大宝 我到后面去拿车 - 长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:53.91,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,换位置，大宝 我走另一边出去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.00,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.90,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,停，大宝 把我调起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:29.67,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,甩出去，大宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.51,0:24:37.04,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.73,0:24:44.30,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,上！ 上！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:50.19,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.41,0:24:54.53,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,大宝，靠边停
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:07.00,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,那些白痴就在我们后面，再开快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.85,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,（时速:63英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.53,0:25:32.69,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,啊，哈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.35,0:26:00.02,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,把我放在这里，大宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.24,0:26:06.74,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:10.16,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,不，不！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.24,0:26:12.70,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,哦，不，不，不，不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:52.53,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,他们转向公墓去了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.63,0:26:56.16,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,快赶去那儿，我先进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:07.93,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,尽管坐在轮椅上 杰弗里克服了残迹带来的种种不便…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.02,0:27:11.89,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,保持着乐观愉快的心情…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:15.18,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,温暖着我们每个认识他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.28,0:27:17.73,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,他把余生贡献给了…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.82,0:27:20.82,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,这个教区的穷人和残疾人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:25.12,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,很好，真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.20,0:27:27.96,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,不，不，请继续，抱歉打断
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.04,0:27:30.91,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,- 很有意思 - 他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:36.08,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,你扮牧师的表演会让牢里其他犯人乐上几个小时的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.18,0:27:39.13,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,哦，抱歉，我的礼貌哪里去了？强尼·英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.22,0:27:42.47,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,英国秘密特工，你们都被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:45.23,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,我得说，你的表演很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.31,0:27:47.93,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,对细节的留意很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.02,0:27:51.19,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,你，伤心的老奶奶，很有说服力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:55.40,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,哦，看啊，真的眼泪 你会得到额外奖励吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.49,0:27:59.40,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,这就是我们都要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.49,0:28:03.03,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,我知道！ 为什么不看看里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.12,0:28:07.87,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,哦，你们已经上了钉子了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:10.42,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,为什么这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.51,0:28:15.50,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,我知道你们会过两个星期再来把它挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:23.17,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,你在这个欺骗和邪恶编织的小插曲里扮演什么角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:25.39,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,我是灵车司机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.48,0:28:28.27,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,- 你是灵车司机？ - 是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.61,0:28:32.85,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,- 你是灵车司机？ - 是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.95,0:28:35.95,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,啊哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:39.49,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,你在这里… 贡特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.58,0:28:43.91,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,呃，我很希望他没有惹你们讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:47.62,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,我是大宝医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:54.72,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,精神病院的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:58.93,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,恐怕贡特 要等到2028年才能被放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.02,0:29:01.85,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,是不是啊，贡特？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:06.40,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,是的，是的，真是非常糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:11.03,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,呃，请原谅，谨表示深深的敬意
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:13.44,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,我无限同情
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.54,0:29:16.24,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,呃，他没有向你们撒尿吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.33,0:29:18.12,*CHS,357,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不，没有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:22.54,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,这是葬礼祝词 把枪给我好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:32.00,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,不是很难，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:36.35,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,你现在回家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.15,0:29:45.78,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,哦… 面包车！我们去上面包车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:48.27,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,好的，好的 卟咙，卟咙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.57,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,- 卟咙，卟咙 卟咙，卟咙 - 好的，好的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.66,0:29:56.21,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,他在挥手道别，再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:29:58.70,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见，贡特
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:01.67,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,继续你们的葬礼 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.85,0:30:11.01,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,走这边的路，那边，一个大台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:14.55,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,这是墓地 人们到这里来…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:16.80,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,好了，现在可以不装了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:20.81,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,- 表面上，我还抓着你的胳膊 - 一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:23.36,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,跑，跑，跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:33.25,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,不敢相信我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:37.63,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,不敢相信真的成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.01,0:30:45.38,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,你们看，200 年前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:50.52,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,我的家族应该继承英格兰的王位
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:53.47,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,但他们被抛弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.57,0:30:56.93,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,再过几天
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:31:00.28,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,他就要物归原主了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:01.34,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,（派斯卡爱德华苏瓦吉）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.99,0:31:05.66,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,也就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.75,0:31:11.29,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,我是不是该试试，是还是不是？也许？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.38,0:31:15.46,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,你的加冕必须由坎特伯雷大主教主持
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.55,0:31:17.71,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,坎特伯雷大主教
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.80,0:31:21.85,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,在我们说话的时候，已经搞定了 目标锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.93,0:31:25.18,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,（目标锁定）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.12,0:31:32.55,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,（面部立体扫描完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:38.02,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,还有一件事，长官 我们怎么处置英格力？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:44.95,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,如果我是你，我就不会担心他英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:48.82,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,他对我们不是危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.24,0:32:19.86,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,很明显，这个叫英格力是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.96,0:32:23.62,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,他也许是傻瓜，但他总是出现
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:27.79,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,那么，下次他出现的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:30.00,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,灭了他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.12,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.59,0:32:34.84,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,迪特克·克来恩和克劳斯·范德塔，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.93,0:32:38.88,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,6个月前刚被释放，他们一共有327项罪名
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.98,0:32:41.10,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,持械抢劫，严重身体伤害…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.19,0:32:43.59,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,还有400张违章停车罚单…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.69,0:32:46.64,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,好的，谢谢，大宝 我想我们已经明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:50.02,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,问题是，长官，范德塔和克来恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.11,0:32:53.65,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,都是苏瓦吉的雇员
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:56.86,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,- 派斯卡·苏瓦吉？ - 正是，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.96,0:32:59.83,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,你意思是苏瓦吉牵扯在内？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:02.08,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,我想不仅仅是牵扯的问题，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.17,0:33:04.63,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,我确信他是主谋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.71,0:33:08.25,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,别蠢了 苏瓦吉雇佣了几千员工
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.34,0:33:11.59,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,其中两个员工是恶棍，并不表示他也是恶棍
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.68,0:33:14.80,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,我希望立刻停止调查他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:16.88,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:25.40,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,今晚，我要参加苏瓦吉招待新任法国大使的晚会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:28.28,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,有什么发现，可以到那里找我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:31.90,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,除了这以外，我不希望你靠近他方圆100英里以内
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.03,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,一定，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:38.21,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,征用命令… 立刻向军情七处军需官要求供应
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.29,0:33:40.35,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,一架军用运输机，加满燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:42.42,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,还要夜间城市上空飞行的许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.51,0:33:44.84,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,两个夜间伪装降落伞，加上储备
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.84,0:33:47.17,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,还有橡胶紧身衣两件，黑色的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:49.55,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,我不喜欢海军兰的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:53.14,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,一件40英寸的防弹衣，因为我要那种袖长
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.23,0:33:54.60,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,- 早上好，菲尔齐 - 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:57.18,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,哦，两个特种部队的印章指环
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.27,0:33:59.27,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,有底色的而且使用色标的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.36,0:34:02.03,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,- 这些干什么用的？ - 今晚的行动用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.11,0:34:04.95,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,我们要打入苏瓦吉的总部
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.03,0:34:07.41,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,- 但柏伽索斯说… - 我来对付柏伽索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:09.70,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,我知道苏瓦吉是幕后的黑手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:11.91,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,今晚我们就是要拿证据
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:15.42,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,- 有什么问题吗，长官？ - 刚才那声音是菲尔齐的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.66,0:34:47.91,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,大宝…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.26,0:35:04.64,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,你到楼上去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.33,0:35:21.32,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:55.77,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,能看见他吗，大宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:59.12,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,他在上面一层，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.71,0:36:06.70,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,他跑不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.93,0:36:17.22,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,像盘曲的毒蛇… 出击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.53,0:36:29.73,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,你怎么认为，长官，一定有两个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:32.11,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,起码两个，大宝 也许4个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:34.32,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,真奇怪，我怎么没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.41,0:36:36.82,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,你不该停留在你的失误上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.91,0:36:40.28,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,- 你必须从中吸取教训，向前进 - 是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:44.42,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,- 你当时在哪里，长官？ - 别谈这个了，大宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.51,0:36:51.80,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,- 啊！ 那是什么，长官？ - 那摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:56.63,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,你把今晚要的东西准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:14.58,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,啊，我们又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:17.29,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,英格力先生 真是个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.38,0:37:19.50,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,我正想你什么时候出现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.59,0:37:24.17,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,正相反，坎贝尔小姐 不是我，是你不停出现
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.26,0:37:26.75,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,你喜欢寿司吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.85,0:37:28.88,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.35,0:37:34.01,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,哦，寿司，我几乎以此为生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.10,0:37:38.05,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,你可以说东方的神秘事物对我一点都不神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.99,0:37:50.99,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,- 清酒？ - 啊，清酒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:54.08,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:59.54,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,祝你女儿都长三个屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.93,0:38:09.40,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,现在，也许你可以解释一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:11.70,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,为什么两次在犯罪现场都遇到你…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.71,0:38:15.60,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,而且在任何一个政府的计算机上都找不到你的记录
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.61,0:38:17.90,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,你为什么不去问政府？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:22.07,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,我就是政府的人，我在问你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:27.95,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.42,0:38:32.04,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,恩，你很勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.13,0:38:35.29,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,他们说海胆是终极美味
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.38,0:38:39.21,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,嗯，那是我的个人最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:47.56,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,我想人们因为它从肛门进食所以觉得它恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.65,0:38:49.97,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.71,0:39:12.83,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,抱歉，我是军情七处的 抱歉，我是秘密特工
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:34.90,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,- 一切就绪了，大宝？ - 快了，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.99,0:39:39.28,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,长官，你介意我再温习一下计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.37,0:39:41.70,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,- 不，不 - 那里有两栋建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.79,0:39:46.42,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,这就是我们的目标，苏瓦吉的总部，在市医院旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:49.84,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,我先跳，降落在屋顶的南边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:53.21,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,用绳子降落14层楼，从这个窗子进去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.30,0:39:57.30,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,我降落在东边，用绳子降12层楼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:40:00.68,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,你就在那儿等我排除警报系统以后给你信号
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:03.34,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你从这个窗子进去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.44,0:40:06.23,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,沿着安全走廊走，进入苏瓦吉的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:09.40,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,- 是的，是的 - 那样能行吗，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:12.57,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,从我想到这个主意起就没有问题，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.95,0:40:19.99,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,哦，我差点忘记了，长官 你的激光信号器
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:23.12,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你的激光信号器！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.92,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,它可以引导你降落到苏瓦吉屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.01,0:40:29.51,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,你对硬件的依赖让我好笑，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.59,0:40:32.43,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,我曾经降落在格拉哈里沙漠…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.51,0:40:37.06,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,什么也没有带，除了一把牙刷和一包柠檬果子露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:41.47,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,但我仍然在斋月前到达了布拉瓦约
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.57,0:40:45.56,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,所以，谢谢你，大宝，但也没什么好谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.53,0:40:50.99,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,大宝，走！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.08,0:40:53.65,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,杰利连摩！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.53,0:41:25.27,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,方丹果！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.31,0:41:51.85,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.45,0:41:59.86,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.43,0:42:18.96,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,警报解除，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.06,0:42:21.05,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,收到，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.46,0:42:52.19,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,（实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:56.06,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,（脑神经科）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.60,0:43:00.60,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,比我想的要糟，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.69,0:43:04.90,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,苏瓦吉在这里搞了格实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.99,0:43:08.15,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,鬼知道他们在这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.53,0:43:24.37,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,上帝，他们把你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.45,0:43:27.78,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,取了点血
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.87,0:43:31.41,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,- 杂种！ - 这是为了做试验
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.50,0:43:34.37,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,当然是，跟我来，朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.46,0:43:37.67,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,在他们取掉你身上其他东西前逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.93,0:43:50.15,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,晚上好，弗兰肯斯坦博士（形容一位科学家在合成人兽合成体）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.23,0:43:52.35,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,请这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.44,0:43:55.31,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,来啊，夜还长着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:58.40,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,还有你们，死亡天使
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.49,0:44:01.24,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,转身，走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.33,0:44:03.65,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,快点，快点，继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.75,0:44:07.28,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,到那边去，我知道你们在这里干什么 还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.37,0:44:10.58,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,快点，快啊，到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.05,0:44:14.92,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.01,0:44:18.13,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,也许你也要带我去见你们的魔鬼老板
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.22,0:44:20.00,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:22.76,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,你知道得很清楚我说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.85,0:44:26.90,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,派斯卡·苏瓦吉的办公室在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.84,0:44:54.96,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,你马上就到了吗，长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.31,0:44:59.13,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,我是军情七处的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:02.18,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,这是在测试你们的紧急发应系统
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.27,0:45:05.52,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,我得说，你们干得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.61,0:45:08.86,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,好吧，那就丢给你们自己管了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.94,0:45:11.02,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,啊，早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.58,0:45:20.87,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,哦，上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.60,0:45:41.93,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,长官 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:52.20,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,你降错地方了？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.29,0:45:56.20,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,我对附近的环境做了一个预防性的检查
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.29,0:45:58.37,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.59,0:46:02.04,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,- 一切顺利 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.13,0:46:04.34,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,好的，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.47,0:46:14.26,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,我到楼下的招待会去…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:25.06,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,- 你们走得太远了 - 晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.16,0:46:28.36,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,- 也许你也喜欢这个 - 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.45,0:46:31.29,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,- 我来给你看 - 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.37,0:46:33.91,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,很有效，大宝，但完全多余
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.00,0:46:37.20,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,- 什么意思，先生？ - 超级力量的肌肉松弛剂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.29,0:46:40.75,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,即便他醒来也是手无缚鸡之力
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:48.80,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.45,0:47:07.07,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,那是坎特伯雷大主教的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.33,0:47:13.17,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,他们在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.13,0:47:20.55,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,这跟王室珠宝有何关联？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:27.53,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,（天国已近  赶快加油）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.49,0:47:44.57,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.27,0:48:04.31,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.39,0:48:07.26,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,有一个人，他的帝国曾…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.36,0:48:10.81,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,覆盖地球的四分之一面积
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.90,0:48:13.27,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,可以，已不再是了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:16.65,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,我的朋友们问我:"派斯卡，你怎么对追溯…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.74,0:48:20.99,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,过去的小王国那么有兴趣？"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.08,0:48:23.91,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,我的回答很简单… 女王
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.00,0:48:27.95,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,我们的女王比全世界上…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.05,0:48:31.63,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,任何一个国家的元首都富有权利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.72,0:48:34.09,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,她可以宣战或选择和平，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.18,0:48:36.55,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,最具魅力的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.64,0:48:41.51,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,她只要愿意就能将她的土地拆分
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.60,0:48:45.47,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,当然了，女王从不用…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.57,0:48:48.35,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,这巨大的力量来自己获利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:53.15,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,但设想下有人用了那力量
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.24,0:48:56.91,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,设想一下，说，我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.99,0:49:01.21,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,他怎么做到的，先生？他怎么弄得自己像个国王？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.29,0:49:03.45,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,大主教
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.14,0:49:15.21,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.52,0:49:20.14,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,举起手来 那样很好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.23,0:49:22.06,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,于夜晚重装身处办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.15,0:49:26.64,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,你个笨蛋，英格力 你绝对无法活着离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.74,0:49:29.03,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,你省省口舌，还是回答我的问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.11,0:49:31.07,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,我不会跟是说任何事情
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.16,0:49:32.90,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:36.11,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,钠喷妥撒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.21,0:49:39.74,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,我不骗你 这可是会让人讲真话的麻药
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.84,0:49:44.54,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,那么，为什么苏瓦吉想要加冕他自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.63,0:49:47.97,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,对于这儿的进程你一无所知，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.05,0:49:51.17,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,如果那不是那么的… 那定会蛮有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.26,0:49:52.64,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:01.98,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,- 他开始胡言乱语了，先生 - 我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.15,0:50:07.16,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,- 他倒在我身上了，先生 - 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.24,0:50:10.66,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,- 你确定你没有把注射管子搞错？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.75,0:50:13.70,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,给外头的门卫注射能说真话的麻药，给克来恩注射松弛剂？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.79,0:50:15.78,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.88,0:50:20.37,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了，大宝 我想我左右手还是会分的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.46,0:50:23.58,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,- 长官？ - 哦，他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.18,0:50:27.22,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,大宝，去拿"flodd"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.31,0:50:31.43,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,- 拿什么啊，长官？ - "Flodd" "Schlage"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.52,0:50:35.02,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,- 我没听清第二个词是什么，长官 - "Schlaaaagh！"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:37.10,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,- 写下来，长官 - "Schlaaaagh！"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.19,0:50:40.31,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.66,0:50:44.23,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,"C" C- A… 啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.32,0:50:48.24,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,车子！坐车！我们是做飞机来的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.33,0:50:51.20,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.29,0:50:53.58,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,在那儿别动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.67,0:50:57.20,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,- 他们怎么啦？ - 我不会跟你们说的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.30,0:51:00.21,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,错误回答
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.30,0:51:02.54,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,你们俩在搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.64,0:51:04.96,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.39,0:51:08.10,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,我们快离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.19,0:51:10.18,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,不好意思，但你是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.27,0:51:12.98,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,特工坎贝尔 我隶属于巴黎的国际刑警组织
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.07,0:51:15.35,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,我们监视苏瓦吉好几个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.44,0:51:17.44,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:20.73,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,因为大多数在这六个月内从苏瓦吉的监狱里…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.82,0:51:23.07,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,释放的犯人已被其的一间公司雇用
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.16,0:51:25.62,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,我们认为他重新召集那帮人是为了个重大的犯罪事件
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.71,0:51:28.41,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,我们就只是不明白要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:32.08,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,- 他说什么？ - 柏伽索斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.17,0:51:34.54,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,我们必须向柏伽索斯报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.63,0:51:36.67,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,哦，不，先生 不，不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:39.88,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么从这儿出去？ - 嘿，你们两个！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.97,0:51:42.76,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,你对我所做的真的有伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.85,0:51:47.26,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,是的 不好意思，我们如何才能不被发现的离开这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.35,0:51:50.14,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.23,0:51:51.52,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,沿着喷泉的左侧走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.52,0:51:52.81,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,再顺着防火出口右边走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.81,0:51:54.10,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,一直走到电梯尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.20,0:51:56.60,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 哦，我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:58.44,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,干得好，大宝
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:01.45,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,左边，长官，左边！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.54,0:52:04.62,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,长官，你不能就这样去苏瓦吉的招待会
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.71,0:52:07.62,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,药物的作用即将用尽
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.71,0:52:09.67,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,我很好…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.76,0:52:12.00,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,真的很好… 啊，非常好…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.14,0:52:24.68,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.82,0:52:31.11,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,- 再来一杯吗？ - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.49,0:52:39.32,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.71,0:52:46.87,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,你搞什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.96,0:52:49.00,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,啊，外交大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.09,0:52:51.63,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.72,0:52:53.63,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.72,0:52:57.09,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,我们跳舞吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:50.12,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,打搅了，先生 很抱歉打扰了您…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.20,0:53:52.33,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,派斯卡，见到你真是太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.41,0:53:55.03,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,- 玩得开心吗？ - 哦，开心得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.12,0:54:00.25,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,我是来通知你，你的人英格力…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.34,0:54:03.29,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,和他那古怪的朋友一整夜的功夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.38,0:54:06.92,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,闯进我的办公室，打伤我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.01,0:54:10.30,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,- 这是真的吗，大宝？ - 嗯，我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.74,0:54:23.03,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,你认为你做了些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.11,0:54:25.98,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,- 长官，如果我能提供… - 回家去，大宝！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.08,0:54:27.90,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.00,0:54:30.62,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,我早就命令过你不要惊动苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.71,0:54:31.86,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,那你干了些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.86,0:54:33.01,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,闯进他的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.01,0:54:34.16,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,打伤他的两个手下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.25,0:54:35.72,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,然后你来到了这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.72,0:54:37.19,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,不知道哪根筋不对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.19,0:54:38.67,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,冒犯了外交大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.76,0:54:41.59,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,30年里我在政府里从没见过如此的举动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.68,0:54:44.59,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,- 但是… - 没有但是，英格力
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.68,0:54:48.30,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,你不用再跟这案子了 你的安全通行就此终结
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.39,0:54:51.76,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,3个月的休假之后，你将返回原级
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.86,0:54:54.98,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,我希望再也见不到你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.79,0:55:50.20,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,英格力知道得太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.30,0:55:52.79,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,执行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.88,0:55:55.29,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,揭穿这假的大主教…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.39,0:55:58.30,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,绿灯访问女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:56:02.22,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,然后这可怜的国家将会因官方上给我加冕…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.31,0:56:04.98,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,而自我羞辱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.66,0:56:20.91,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,（女王在桑德灵厄姆的住处）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.17,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,这是封让位证明…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.26,0:56:35.25,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,关于断绝你与王位关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:38.43,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,以及你整个家族关系的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.52,0:56:40.51,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,签字
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.12,0:56:47.29,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,（逊位书）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.57,0:56:50.65,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,决不
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.79,0:57:05.38,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.47,0:57:07.01,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,总理先生，抱歉那么晚打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.01,0:57:08.55,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,但我担心女王就要让位了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:10.34,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.43,0:57:14.84,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,让位？但那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.14,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,我只希望那是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.23,0:57:21.36,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,- 让我跟她说 也许她只是… - 派斯卡，她已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.44,0:57:24.19,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,我的人已经花了10个小时…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.28,0:57:27.86,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,来确认王位的合法继承人…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.95,0:57:31.20,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,他们提出个人的名字，这是他们双手赞同的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.29,0:57:33.78,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.87,0:57:36.99,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:44.42,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,清晨王室珠宝返还到…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.51,0:57:46.55,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,伦敦北部的一警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.64,0:57:49.39,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,派斯卡·苏瓦吉的加冕仪式…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.47,0:57:52.01,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,将于本周四举行
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.10,0:57:55.40,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,在议院，总理说他期盼着这场盛典…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.41,0:57:58.69,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,他相信苏瓦吉绅士将会是个好国王…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.78,0:58:03.60,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,他会给我们旧有的制度带来最好的现代欧洲的制度
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.12,0:58:13.79,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,带上你的车钥匙我们有活要干了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.88,0:58:17.04,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,- 坎贝尔小姐 - 苏瓦吉正以首脑的姿态回法国去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:21.79,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,他邀请了世界上最富有的13个犯罪策划到那儿见他
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.89,0:58:25.34,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,对不起，坎贝尔小姐 我不再跟这个案子了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.64,0:58:27.01,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,案子被重新分配了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.10,0:58:29.77,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,我知道 重新分配给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.44,0:58:36.15,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,- 我想要你跟我一块儿 - 就让我一个人待着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:40.02,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,你是愿意坐在这令人不爽的公寓里自怨自艾呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.11,0:58:43.36,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,还是愿意出去拯救你的国家呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.58,0:58:46.90,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,我要待在这公寓里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.00,0:58:51.08,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,- 强尼，这太可笑了 - 我是个废人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.84,0:58:55.67,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,废啊，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.55,0:59:02.38,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:06.13,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,请…你… 住…手？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.08,0:59:21.15,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,我要迟一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.36,0:59:33.92,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,（新王派斯卡苏瓦吉登基典礼）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.22,0:59:43.47,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,（法国北部）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.38,1:00:10.04,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,一个小时候就是黄昏 接着我们就能朝城堡进发了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.13,1:00:13.38,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,可问题是，那一时刻苏瓦吉把王冠戴在头上
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.47,1:00:16.72,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,他就能对我所爱的国家为所欲为了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.81,1:00:19.56,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,那就是为何你我要来阻止他的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.35,1:00:25.02,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,- 考虑那个想法？ - 差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.99,1:00:31.74,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,我猜你跟很多女人做过爱，不是吗，强尼？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.49,1:00:38.24,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,啊，嗯，你知道啦，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.33,1:00:41.04,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,某人未必尽其全力
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.50,1:00:44.33,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,就只是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:49.46,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,嗯，我未婚夫离开我已经三年了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.55,1:00:53.39,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,从那之后我就没跟任何人做过爱
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.47,1:00:55.38,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,但我遇到你后…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:00:59.69,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,我感觉到了… 这种冲动…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.77,1:01:03.02,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,在蠢蠢欲动
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.11,1:01:06.31,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,我想要跟你说些事情，我想跟你做些什么事…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.41,1:01:10.95,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,那种事我已经很久很久没想要做过了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:17.83,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.92,1:01:20.79,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,我们在谈些什么事情啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:23.80,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,关于在你脸上拍击的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.88,1:01:27.25,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,关于在你后面华而不实的偷袭你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.35,1:01:31.64,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,但然后我开始看到脱俗的事物
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.73,1:01:34.76,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,我开始看到里面有个人…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.85,1:01:36.91,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,他坚守他的职责
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.91,1:01:38.98,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,无论遇到什么困难
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.07,1:01:43.02,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,接着我开始感觉到了些其它的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.11,1:01:47.94,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,我想为他做些其它的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.04,1:01:50.49,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,事情…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.58,1:01:54.36,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,包括塑胶玩具和软干酪？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.46,1:01:59.17,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 什么？什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.26,1:02:03.72,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,你在戏耍我 你正在叫我不要这么温柔的对你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:05.88,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,不是的…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.97,1:02:07.63,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,你是个特殊的人…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.73,1:02:10.93,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,当我易受攻击时不利用我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.02,1:02:13.56,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,- 不，可是… - 谢谢你…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:15.94,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,是如此的有绅士风度
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.49,1:02:20.78,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,那没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.31,1:02:44.76,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么，坎贝尔小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.77,1:02:48.60,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,如果我们不阻止这一切，天知道英国会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:52.10,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,实际上，我在想那肯定有比那管子更好的途径
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.23,1:02:54.40,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,可是没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:58.48,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,我已经从各个方面分析过了，这是最好的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.57,1:03:02.36,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,我先上，如果路线很明确，我就联络你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:06.16,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,强尼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.25,1:03:09.54,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 我一直很小心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:11.50,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:04.48,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.57,1:04:06.44,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,再过几小时时间…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:09.20,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,我将成为下任英国国王
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.72,1:04:29.21,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,哦，不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.61,1:04:49.48,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,- 你怎么进来这儿的？ - 爬梯子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.58,1:04:52.11,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,这没什么，就是有一点臭罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.33,1:04:59.50,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,哦！好冷啊！好冷啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.96,1:05:01.71,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,世上从没见过用尽的…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.80,1:05:06.67,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,货品是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.76,1:05:08.88,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,是罪犯，先生们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.97,1:05:11.26,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,犯法着
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.35,1:05:15.10,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,世界上每个国家为解决这个问题…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.19,1:05:17.94,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,而建造监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.02,1:05:23.36,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,那么，我们与所有这些坏人做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.45,1:05:26.48,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,找到解决那个问题的方法…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.58,1:05:30.95,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,世界上的政府们将会永远酬谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:35.30,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,很幸运，我找到了个解决的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.38,1:05:41.30,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,我们清空这个星球上所有的监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:46.59,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,我们把这群人类的渣滓…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.68,1:05:49.35,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,汇总到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.90,1:05:56.40,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,此刻我加冕为国王
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.48,1:05:59.19,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,我将把英国变成世界历史上…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.28,1:06:02.15,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,最大的监狱
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.41,1:06:07.07,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,21万平方英里…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.16,1:06:09.32,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,作为最初的地产…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.42,1:06:13.12,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,方便的从人类真实文明中分开…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:15.45,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,用20英里的海洋…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.55,1:06:17.79,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,- 不久全世界就有可能… - 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.88,1:06:23.84,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,把他们的犯人关到这里来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.93,1:06:26.01,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,根据潮流的设计，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.10,1:06:32.02,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,我们可以使用该监狱至少500年
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.11,1:06:36.19,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,所以今晚，你们当中将仅有一个人…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.28,1:06:41.36,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,可以赢得49%的机会…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.45,1:06:43.86,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.96,1:06:48.87,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,所以那就是他的小把戏 我们必须得到那DVD
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:52.08,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,但怎么做呢，强尼？我们就只有两个人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.17,1:06:54.41,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,你还年轻，坎贝尔小姐，而且没有经验
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.51,1:06:56.83,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,你看起来忘记了…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.93,1:06:59.40,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,没人知道我们在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.40,1:07:03.97,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,我们该作出至关重要的决定
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:07.15,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,现今，我的计划简单但有效
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.23,1:07:10.00,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,我将在房间尽头的走廊降落
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.02,1:07:11.81,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,然后逮住苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.90,1:07:13.95,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,你接着从远门端进来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.95,1:07:16.00,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,切断任何逃跑路线
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.05,1:07:18.56,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,然后，将苏瓦吉作为人质
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.56,1:07:21.07,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,我们就能离开这鬼地方 明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.59,1:07:31.88,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,举起手来，你个法国男妓
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.97,1:07:36.51,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,不过，英格力先生，我真得很吃惊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.60,1:07:39.09,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,真是意想不到的吃惊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.18,1:07:42.80,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,惊奇非常是我的专业，苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.06,1:07:46.85,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,我想这我们已经看够了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.94,1:07:53.78,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,我很清楚地明白你们的计划，我来这就是为了阻止它
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.87,1:07:58.61,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,我的屁股也会在你之前成为英国国王的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.71,1:08:00.70,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,又错了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.79,1:08:04.00,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,或许你介意看看你身后
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.09,1:08:06.41,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,哦，请了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.55,1:08:11.63,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,萝娜！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.43,1:08:16.51,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,对不起，强尼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.60,1:08:20.52,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,好吧，我很遗憾今晚我们不得不…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.61,1:08:23.31,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,结束夜总会的节目表演了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.40,1:08:25.23,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,没那么容易，苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.32,1:08:29.82,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,你可以抓住我，但你永远控制不了英国
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.91,1:08:32.70,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,不只是我还能呼吸…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.79,1:08:35.08,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,还有我枪中有子弹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.22,1:08:48.88,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,你知道吗，英格力先生，我真的会想你的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.97,1:08:51.21,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,你真得很搞笑，我谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.31,1:08:52.97,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,带他们走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.65,1:08:59.39,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,大家早上好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.48,1:09:01.64,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,欢迎收听早餐秀
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.03,1:09:07.28,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,人群在这儿集结就是为了我们首位法国国王的加冕…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.37,1:09:09.49,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,自从1066年以来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.58,1:09:14.54,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,这是伦敦调频，我们将通过热线电话述说我们最爱法国的10件事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.63,1:09:18.08,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,我们目前还没接到任何热线
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.17,1:09:21.71,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,但线路依然开通着，我将再播报一次热线号码…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.80,1:09:24.92,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,０－２－０－７…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.60,1:09:29.80,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,这不对，强尼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:32.05,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,我们该好好想想
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.81,1:09:37.06,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,等等，我有主意了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.15,1:09:38.78,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,跳！ 跳！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.86,1:09:42.61,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,再跳！ 再跳！停！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.70,1:09:45.15,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,现在，你对危地马拉三角洲的…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.24,1:09:48.94,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,萨满教道士用喉咙发颤音熟悉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.04,1:09:50.41,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.50,1:09:52.49,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,他们很久以来信奉…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.59,1:09:56.63,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,口哨的发音频率会引起金属锁的共鸣…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.72,1:10:00.80,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,共鸣所产生的震动将会使门很轻松的打开
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.89,1:10:02.76,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.85,1:10:05.80,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,跪下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.77,1:10:11.69,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,好的 开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.12,1:10:27.41,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,- 我听不到任何声音了 - 我在发出超声波
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.50,1:10:30.42,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,强尼，你能不那么干而面对现实吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.50,1:10:34.25,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,我们失败了 能救我们的唯一希望就是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.14,1:10:42.80,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,有效果了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.89,1:10:45.64,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,- 哦！ - 长官？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.86,1:10:56.90,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,我不知道你为什么要从那该死的排粪管进来，大宝
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.99,1:11:00.78,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,在那旁边有个很棒的梯子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.87,1:11:03.28,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,现在，苏瓦吉可能已经愚弄了这个国家…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.37,1:11:06.13,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,靠他的假大主教，和他的秘密议程，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.21,1:11:08.58,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,但他没法愚弄我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.01,1:11:12.54,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,那么，计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.45,1:12:47.44,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,阁下，你将神圣的被涂油证明为…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.53,1:12:53.82,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,一个真正的君主，未来的派斯卡国王
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.92,1:12:57.96,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,派斯卡，你愿意宣誓吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.05,1:13:01.46,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.55,1:13:05.05,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,那么你将被涂上…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.14,1:13:08.92,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,这圣油
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.31,1:13:15.64,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,你所选定的，英格兰、苏格兰和威尔士的主教，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.73,1:13:18.57,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,愿意涂上圣油吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.65,1:13:21.19,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,为了苏格兰，我愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.28,1:13:22.99,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,为了威尔士，我愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.91,1:13:26.94,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,为了英格兰，我不愿意！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.04,1:13:30.79,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,英格力！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.09,1:13:37.75,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,那家伙不能被加冕为国王，因为他是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.84,1:13:40.63,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,一个骗子，一个吹牛者，还是一个贼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.72,1:13:44.34,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,没事，让他说下去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.18,1:13:49.18,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,这家伙，派斯卡·苏瓦吉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.27,1:13:52.47,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,他偷了王室珠宝
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.57,1:13:54.77,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,他强迫女王让位…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.86,1:13:58.77,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,他会杀死所有挡他路的人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.86,1:14:00.82,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,结束了，英格力先生
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.54,1:14:06.03,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,他已经欺骗并操纵…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.12,1:14:08.88,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,这伟大的国家为他自己的目的所用
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.96,1:14:11.28,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,他愚弄了你们全部所有人！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.30,1:14:16.75,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,更有甚者，这整个典礼都是假的…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.84,1:14:20.43,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,因为那个站在你们面前的人…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.51,1:14:23.68,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,不是坎特伯雷大主教
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.15,1:14:29.98,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,英格力，给你个忠告: 别到那儿去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.07,1:14:34.61,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,闭嘴，法国佬，我愿意到哪儿就去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:38.20,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,- 现在把面具摘下来 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.28,1:14:41.65,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,你的面具是塑胶造的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.33,1:14:45.29,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,立即摘掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.38,1:14:47.87,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,我不明白你在说些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.96,1:14:52.01,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,好吧 我自己动手摘掉它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.09,1:14:56.30,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,赶快啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.39,1:14:59.67,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,或许要从前面来弄掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.77,1:15:02.22,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,快啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.58,1:15:20.12,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,- 啊！ - 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.92,1:15:23.96,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,某处定有连接的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.04,1:15:26.96,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,总是神神道道，英格力先生
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.05,1:15:29.67,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,但我想我们必须继续
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.76,1:15:34.14,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,没人可以离开，直到我最终揭穿这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.22,1:15:37.26,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,你是否在你的…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.35,1:15:40.55,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,屁股上纹有如下文字
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.65,1:15:43.68,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,“天国已近，赶快加油？”
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:47.82,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,你是不是有神经病啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.91,1:15:50.15,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,好吧，让我们找出来看看，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.24,1:15:52.91,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,我们来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.05,1:16:04.37,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,棒极了！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.68,1:16:17.76,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,好吧，对于大主教的屁股我是搞错了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.57,1:16:22.35,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,- 但是还有 - 但是我恐怕今天没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.44,1:16:24.90,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,警卫，把这家伙带走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.99,1:16:28.69,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,- 但对他要斯文点 - 你认为就那样了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.78,1:16:31.19,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,你认为我就没有更多的证据了？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.29,1:16:34.74,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,我最忠诚的属下争看着部DVD…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.83,1:16:38.45,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,那里面有苏瓦吉对这个国家的丑恶计划
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.55,1:16:40.75,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,把他拖出去！把他拖出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.84,1:16:44.71,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,- 方啊，大宝！ 快播放那光盘！ - 放啊！就现在！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.26,1:17:04.57,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,∮ 你多么热辣戏弄我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.66,1:17:10.49,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,∮ 你正忧郁，但我不能趁机占你这样年轻女孩的便宜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.58,1:17:13.73,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,∮ 这是我不会做的事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.74,1:17:18.85,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,∮ 噢，我可以和你跳舞，宝贝如果你觉得这样有趣的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.94,1:17:21.61,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,∮ 你妈妈知道你出来了吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.70,1:17:25.24,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,∮ 我会对你叫嚣，宝贝，或许你可以风骚一些 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.34,1:17:28.33,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,∮ 你妈妈知道你出来了吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.42,1:17:31.01,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,∮ 不要紧张 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:33.37,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,∮ 最好慢一些，女孩，你无路可走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.46,1:17:36.81,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,∮ 你妈妈知道你出来了吗？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.50,1:17:47.82,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,- 诶！ - 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.01,1:17:58.21,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,那么，我们继续吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.81,1:18:08.10,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,那么正如所罗门王…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.19,1:18:12.52,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,让匝多克牧师和内森先知涂圣油为王
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.61,1:18:16.06,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,所以你被涂以圣油…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.16,1:18:18.07,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,尊崇为王…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.87,1:18:23.45,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,统治所有上帝…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.54,1:18:25.53,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,所分派与你的…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.63,1:18:29.12,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,人民…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.21,1:18:32.58,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,及他们所在的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.68,1:18:34.58,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.68,1:18:39.05,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,那么，以天父之名…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.14,1:18:40.80,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,以圣子之名…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.89,1:18:42.89,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,及圣灵之名
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.94,1:18:47.18,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,我为您加冕…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.78,1:18:53.61,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.70,1:18:55.78,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,- 还给我！ - 不！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.87,1:18:57.78,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,- 那是我的王冠！ - 决不给你！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.87,1:19:01.41,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,- 还给我！ - 数百万年都绝不给你，苏瓦吉！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.50,1:19:03.46,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,- 给我！ - 下来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.54,1:19:06.25,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.63,1:19:10.09,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,还给我！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.84,1:19:13.80,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,- 停！ - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:19.77,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,所有这些小国家要做的就是站成一条线…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.85,1:19:23.30,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,干那些受难日该干的事！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.40,1:19:25.30,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,但做不到呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.40,1:19:29.64,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,我的法国香屁股可以！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.45,1:19:36.30,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.04,1:19:40.58,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.92,1:19:44.96,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,给我加冕！快加冕！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.14,1:19:52.51,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,那么，以天父之名…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.60,1:19:55.05,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,以圣子之名，还有圣灵之名，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.27,1:19:57.81,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,我加冕您为…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.82,1:20:02.69,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.78,1:20:04.85,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.81,1:20:34.89,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,逮捕那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.98,1:20:37.14,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,把他锁起来抓走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.50,1:21:29.37,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,言语已不能表达我们对你们所做一切的由衷敬意
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.46,1:21:31.87,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,那都是我应该做的，夫人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.96,1:21:37.09,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,作为回报，你的女王跟国家能为你做些什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.18,1:21:39.38,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.47,1:21:43.47,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,因为有人要求，夫人…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.56,1:21:46.76,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,在庆祝回归王位的庆典上，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.85,1:21:49.89,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,女王宣布8月5日为国定假日…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.98,1:21:54.61,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,并授予无名的军情七处探员骑士身份…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:58.86,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,以表彰他粉碎法国商人派斯卡·苏瓦吉的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.95,1:22:01.57,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,苏瓦吉正等待着以叛国罪的审判
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.66,1:22:03.90,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,这是会处以极刑的罪名
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.00,1:22:07.60,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,如果发现有罪，他会被要求捐赠大脑来做医学研究…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.54,1:22:11.54,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,来进一步探究狂躁精神病
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.63,1:22:14.20,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,期间，无名的英格力探员已经离开了这国家…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:18.43,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,踏上了他下一个新的任务的征途
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.35,1:22:24.39,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,（法国南部某处）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.48,1:22:26.72,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,强尼·英格力长官
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.82,1:22:29.69,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,女王看起来很感激的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.32,1:22:33.48,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,她不是唯一
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.13,1:22:45.38,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,嗯 你充满惊奇
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:53.13,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.22,1:22:56.89,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,- 强尼！ - 哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.39,1:23:30.83,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,（功臣英格力授勋为爵士）
